    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Chaos is a first-person survival horror game set in a cursed summer camp. Explore abandoned cabins and dark ritual sites, craft traps, solve eerie puzzles, and fight to survive the night as you search for your missing child.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> cabins, caves, and ritual zones while uncovering the camp\u2019s disturbing history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and complete rituals</strong> to progress through locked areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft traps</strong> using scavenged materials like limbs and scraps to slow down threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> by using stealth, distraction, or traps</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven single-player horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with puzzle-solving and light crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trap system built around scavenging parts from the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, atmospheric environments: forest trails, bunkhouses, caves, ritual chambers</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Chaos is a first-person survival horror game set in a cursed summer camp. Explore abandoned cabins and dark ritual sites, craft traps, solve eerie puzzles, and fight to survive the night as you search for your missing child.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> cabins, caves, and ritual zones while uncovering the camp\u2019s disturbing history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and complete rituals</strong> to progress through locked areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft traps</strong> using scavenged materials like limbs and scraps to slow down threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> by using stealth, distraction, or traps</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven single-player horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with puzzle-solving and light crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trap system built around scavenging parts from the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, atmospheric environments: forest trails, bunkhouses, caves, ritual chambers</p></li></ul>",
